  ],
  "narrative": [
    "reviews_per_day is 1 and three review cards are overdue.",
    "Step 0: one review is served and counted.",
    "Step 1: updateSettings turns scheduler.reviews_unlimited on (the shell mints settings.set as the device; the server as the server device).",
